@startuml
!theme plain
title StreamHub — System Architecture & Availability Flow

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

package "Mobile App (Flutter / CMP)" {
  [Discovery Rails\n(Trending, Top Rated, Genres)]
  [Search\n(TMDB)]
  [Watchlists]
  [Deep-Link Handoff\n(url_launcher / Intents / UIApplication)]
  [Onboard: Subscription\nToggles]
}

package "Supabase (Free Tier)" {
  database "Postgres" as DB {
    [users]
    [user_watchlists]
    [subscription_preferences]
    [availability_cache\n(24h TTL)]
  }
  [Edge Functions\n(Deno/TypeScript)\navailability proxy]
}

component "TMDB API (free)" as TMDB
component "Watchmode /\nStreaming Avail. API" as AVAIL
component "Provider Native Apps\n(Netflix, Disney+, Max,\nPrime Video, Apple TV+)" as PROVIDER

[Onboard: Subscription Toggles] --> [Discovery Rails] : filters active services
[Discovery Rails] --> DB : subscription_preferences
[Search] --> TMDB : metadata, posters, trailers
[Search] --> [Watchlists]

[Watchlists] --> DB : user_watchlists
[Deep-Link Handoff] --> [Edge Functions] : availability lookup (cache-first)
[Edge Functions] --> DB : query cache first
DB --> [Edge Functions] : hit (≤24h) → return
[Edge Functions] --> AVAIL : cache miss → on-demand
AVAIL --> [Edge Functions] : region availability + deep links
[Edge Functions] --> [Deep-Link Handoff] : resolve owner + link
[Deep-Link Handoff] --> [Provider Native Apps] : OS deep link (nflx://)
[Deep-Link Handoff] --> [Provider Web Portal] : fallback (app not installed)

note right of DB
  GitHub Actions keep-alive
  pings to prevent free-tier
  DB pause
end note

@enduml